  <summary>Tipitaka Reader in Multiple Languages</summary>
  <developer id="org.epitaka">
    <name>dhammanana</name>
  </developer>
  <description>
    <p>ePitaka is a reader for the Tipitaka — the Pali Buddhist canon — with translations in multiple languages.</p>
    <p>Features include:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Read the Tipitaka in Pali with parallel translations (Sinhala, Thai, Burmese, Vietnamese, Lao, Tamil, Portuguese and more)</li>
      <li>Integrated Pali dictionary (DPD) with word lookup while reading</li>
      <li>Download additional translations on demand</li>
      <li>Text-to-speech reading of Pali texts</li>
      <li>Search across the canon</li>
    </ul>
  </description>
